    monster you control; banish it (until the Standby Phase of your next turn), and
    if you do, add 1 "Mekk-Knight" monster from your Deck to your hand, except "Mekk-Knight
    Purple Nightfall". You can only use this effect of "Mekk-Knight Purple Nightfall"
    once per turn.'
